{
  "page": 521,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4682,
      "text": "Demi langit yang mempunyai jalan-jalan,811)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4683,
      "text": "sungguh, kamu benar-benar dalam keadaan berbeda-beda pendapat.812)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4684,
      "text": "Dipalingkan darinya (Al-Qur`an dan Rasul) orang yang dipalingkan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4685,
      "text": "Terkutuklah orang-orang yang banyak berdusta,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4686,
      "text": "(yaitu) orang-orang yang terbenam dalam kebodohan dan kelalaian.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4687,
      "text": "Mereka bertanya, \"Kapankah hari pembalasan itu?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4688,
      "text": "(Hari pembalasan itu ialah) pada hari (ketika) mereka diazab di dalam api neraka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4689,
      "text": "(Dikatakan kepada mereka), \"Rasakanlah azabmu itu. Inilah azab yang dahulu kamu minta agar disegerakan.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4690,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang bertakwa berada di dalam taman-taman (surga) dan mata air,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4691,
      "text": "mereka mengambil apa yang diberikan Tuhan kepada mereka. Sesungguhnya mereka sebelum itu (di dunia) adalah orang-orang yang berbuat baik;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4692,
      "text": "mereka sedikit sekali tidur pada waktu malam;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4693,
      "text": "dan pada akhir malam mereka memohon ampunan (kepada Allah).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4694,
      "text": "Dan pada harta benda mereka ada hak untuk orang miskin yang meminta, dan orang miskin yang tidak meminta.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4695,
      "text": "Dan di bumi terdapat tanda-tanda (kebesaran Allah) bagi orang-orang yang yakin,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4696,
      "text": "dan (juga) pada dirimu sendiri. Maka apakah kamu tidak memperhatikan?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4697,
      "text": "Dan di langit terdapat (sebab-sebab) rezekimu dan apa yang dijanjikan kepadamu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4698,
      "text": "Maka demi Tuhan langit dan bumi, sungguh, apa yang dijanjikan itu pasti terjadi sebagaimana kamu (bisa) berbicara.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4699,
      "text": "Sudahkah sampai kepadamu (Muhammad) cerita tamu Ibrahim (malaikat-malaikat) yang dimuliakan?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4700,
      "text": "(Ingatlah) ketika mereka masuk ke tempatnya lalu mengucapkan, \"Salāman (salam).\" Ibrahim menjawab, \"Salāmun (salam)\". (Mereka itu) orang-orang yang belum dikenalnya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4701,
      "text": "Maka diam-diam dia (Ibrahim) pergi menemui keluarganya, kemudian dibawanya daging anak sapi gemuk (yang dibakar).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4702,
      "text": "Lalu dihidangkannya kepada mereka (tetapi mereka tidak mau makan). Ibrahim berkata, \"Mengapa tidak kamu makan.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4703,
      "text": "Maka dia (Ibrahim) merasa takut terhadap mereka. Mereka berkata, \"Janganlah kamu takut.\" Dan mereka memberi kabar gembira kepadanya dengan (kelahiran) seorang anak yang alim (Ishak).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4704,
      "text": "Kemudian istrinya datang memekik (tercengang) lalu menepuk wajahnya sendiri seraya bekata, \"(Aku ini) seorang perempuan tua yang mandul.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4705,
      "text": "Mereka berkata, \"Demikianlah Tuhanmu berfirman. Sungguh, Dialah Yang Mahabijaksana, Maha Mengetahui.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
  "language": "id"
}
